Package: tenniscareer
Title: Retrieve and Plot Tennis Career Matches from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kassem", "Lim", email = "kassemlim@berkeley.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads a professional tennis player's career match file
    from Tennis Abstract <https://www.tennisabstract.com/>, parses the
    JavaScript match array, and returns a clean data frame with the
    player's age, the opponent's age, the age difference, and the outcome
    of every played match. Handles both the women's format (opponent date
    of birth) and the men's format (opponent age). A companion function
    draws a scatter plot of age difference against the player's age,
    coloured by wins and losses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.3.0),
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
